Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:20.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1163)}You want to get 10,000 naira\Ntoday
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.42,0:00:23.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1163)}Two weeks time you get the\N10,000
