Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.22,0:00:43.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1163)}You will get 10,000 naira now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:46.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1163)}And hereafter on the day of\NQiyamah
