Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.24,0:00:53.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1163)}this dunya that Allah will\Ngive you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.54,0:00:55.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1163)}Then your statement may be\Ncorrect
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.44,0:00:58.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1163)}So if what you want to\Ncollect
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.26,0:01:00.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1163)}in the immediate
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.64,0:01:01.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1163)}And what you will collect in\Nthe
