Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.60,0:01:10.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1163)}It is better to collect it\Nimmediately
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.92,0:01:21.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1163)}But if they are different
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.14,0:01:23.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1163)}If in the immediate
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.26,0:01:26.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1163)}You would collect 10,000\Nnaira for example
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.34,0:01:29.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1163)}And in one year's time of the
