Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.80,0:01:36.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1163)}You will collect one billion
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.14,0:01:38.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1163)}He said
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.62,0:01:45.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1163)}Then collecting it later is\Nbetter and
